@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# MDL-88683: Blog links in the user profile
+
+When blogs are enabled, the Miscellaneous section of the user profile shows two blog links wherever the blog profile link was previously shown:
+
+* **View my blog entries** (previously "Blog entries") opens the viewed user's own blog entries.
+* **View site blog entries** (new) opens the site-wide blog listing (/blog/index.php).
+
+When blogs are disabled, neither link is shown. Blog permissions and page behaviour are unchanged. This replaces the Navigation block link to site blogs for Boost.
